OL,3,AEight killed in series of shootings in
OL,4,Awestern Turkey
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight people have been killed and one
OL,7,Fseriously injured in a series of
OL,8,Fshootings in western Turkey.
OL,10,FThe attacks took place in the
OL,11,FAfyonkarahisar province on Thursday,
OL,12,Fwith victims found in several locations
OL,13,Fin three separate vehicles, according
OL,14,Fto local reports.
OL,16,FThe suspect fled, triggering a manhunt,
OL,17,Fand authorities later said he had been
OL,18,Farrested in EskiE_ehir province.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
